Files: src/qt/res/animation/spinner-*.png
       src/qt/res/src/spinner.svg
Copyright: 2026, The Quicksilver developers
License: Expat
Comment: Original artwork (the Quicksilver sync spinner: a 270-degree arc led
         by a head dot). spinner.svg is frame 0 and the reviewable source; the
         36 PNG frames are rotations of it about the canvas centre. Regenerate
         with contrib/devtools/gen-qt-spinner.py. This replaces the upstream
         spinner inherited from Bitcoin Core, whose own provenance upstream
         never recorded and which therefore fell through to Files: *.

